WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.714
For a one-off change, open Calendar and
select the date you need.

00:00:05.614 --> 00:00:07.298
Open the shift editor for that day.

00:00:08.148 --> 00:00:11.174
We'll choose Off here, then save the
change.

00:00:12.474 --> 00:00:16.518
That changes this day without rewriting the
rotation for future weeks.

00:00:17.418 --> 00:00:20.136
Check the saved day against what you meant
to change.

00:00:21.336 --> 00:00:25.358
If it should follow the pattern again, open
the editor and remove the change.

00:00:26.608 --> 00:00:30.869
To change the repeating rotation itself,
use Workplaces instead.

00:00:31.869 --> 00:00:36.628
And if you're recording that you didn't
work a planned shift, use Not working today
on Today.
